      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, we have a huge problem. that memo about the community center vote just leaked to the press. reporters are already blowing up my phone asking why the candidate voted against it. if this gets out as just \"he voted against community funding,\" we're dead in the water for the upcoming election. how do we spin this so it doesn't look like he's anti-community?",
